# BeJiuJitsu Development Server + Playwright Setup

## Optimal Command Sequence:
```bash
# 1. Kill any existing expo processes to prevent port conflicts
pkill -f "expo start" 2>/dev/null || true

# 2. Start the web development server
npm run web
```

## After server starts (look for "Bundled" messages), open Playwright:
- Navigate to: http://localhost:8081
- Set mobile viewport: 375x667 (iPhone SE size)
- Take screenshot if needed for visual verification

## Notes:
- The `pkill` command prevents port 8081 conflicts
- `2>/dev/null || true` ensures graceful handling if no processes exist
- Server typically takes 10-15 seconds to fully bundle and be ready
- Look for "Bundled" and "Waiting on http://localhost:8081" messages
- Warnings about deprecated shadow props and missing record.tsx export are expected